        "text": "<thinking> The existing `extract_text.py` file uses AWS Textract to extract text from a document. I will use AWS Textract for the other same-scenario files as well to maintain consistency. For the later-step files, I will use different providers to demonstrate integration with multiple external services. </thinking>\n\n<thinking> I have created the `extract_layout.py` file using AWS Textract to extract layout elements from a document. Next, I will create the `extract_tables.py` file to extract table cells and row structure from a document. </thinking>",
